34}, {"id": 46, "seek": 18756, "start": 187.56, "end": 194.52, "text": " Look at here.", "tokens": [50363, 6803, 379, 994, 13, 50711], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2701959724885872, "compression_ratio": 1.6547619047619047, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005710151162929833}, {"id": 47, "seek": 18756, "start": 195.44, "end": 197.64000000000001, "text": " Do you see this Fair Value Gap right here?", "tokens": [50757, 2141, 345, 766, 428, 7011, 11052, 33899, 826, 994, 30, 50867], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2701959724885872, "compression_ratio": 1.6547619047619047, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005710151162929833}, {"id": 48, "seek": 18756, "start": 198.48, "end": 199.72, "text": " From here to here.", "tokens": [50909, 3574, 994, 284, 994, 13, 50971], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2701959724885872, "compression_ratio": 1.6547619047619047, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005710151162929833}, {"id": 49, "seek": 18756, "start": 201.04, "end": 205.2, "text": " What happened is price did not respect this old Fair Value Gap.", "tokens": [51037, 1867, 3022, 318, 2756, 750, 407, 2461, 428, 1468, 7011, 11052, 33899, 13, 51245], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2701959724885872, "compression_ratio": 1.6547619047619047, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005710151162929833}, {"id": 50, "seek": 18756, "start": 205.64000000000001, "end": 210.2, "text": " And what happened is price went back up and did market structure shift.", "tokens": [51267, 843, 644, 3022, 318, 2756, 1816, 736, 510, 290, 750, 1910, 4645, 6482, 13, 51495], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2701959724885872, "compression_ratio": 1.6547619047619047, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005710151162929833}, {"id": 51, "seek": 18756, "start": 210.36, "end": 210.76, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [51503, 16805, 13, 51523], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2701959724885872, "compression_ratio": 1.6547619047619047, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005710151162929833}, {"id": 52, "seek": 18756, "start": 211.36, "end": 215.6, "text": " Now, look at this, this Fair Value Gap is way too big.", "tokens": [51553, 2735, 11, 804, 379, 428, 11, 428, 7011, 11052, 33899, 318, 835, 1165, 1263, 13, 51765], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2701959724885872, "compression_ratio": 1.6547619047619047, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005710151162929833}, {"id": 53, "seek": 18756, "start": 215.64000000000001, "end": 216.04, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [51767, 16805, 13, 51787], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2701959724885872, "compression_ratio": 1.6547619047619047, "no_speech_prob": 0.0005710151162929833}, {"id": 54, "seek": 21604, "start": 217.04, "end": 218.0, "text": " It's just way too big.", "tokens": [50413, 632, 338, 655, 835, 1165, 1263, 13, 50461], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1571346220079359, "compression_ratio": 1.7222222222222223, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012136056320741773}, {"id": 55, "seek": 21604, "start": 218.0, "end": 222.72, "text": " So if you take your entry from the here, your stop loss is going to be huge.", "tokens": [50461, 1406, 611, 345, 1011, 534, 5726, 422, 262, 994, 11, 534, 2245, 2994, 318, 1016, 284, 307, 3236, 13, 50697], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1571346220079359, "compression_ratio": 1.7222222222222223, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012136056320741773}, {"id": 56, "seek": 21604, "start": 223.0, "end": 233.64, "text": " But if you look at here, you have BPR and the new Fair Value Gap is overlapping with the old Fair Value Gap.", "tokens": [50711, 887, 611, 345, 804, 379, 994, 11, 345, 423, 347, 4805, 290, 262, 649, 7011, 11052, 33899, 318, 32997, 351, 262, 1468, 7011, 11052, 33899, 13, 51243], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1571346220079359, "compression_ratio": 1.7222222222222223, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012136056320741773}, {"id": 57, "seek": 21604, "start": 235.16, "end": 242.56, "text": " So in this case, what you can do is you can take your entry from the BPR or old Fair Value Gap.", "tokens": [51319, 1406, 287, 428, 1339, 11, 644, 345, 460, 466, 318, 345, 460, 1011, 534, 5726, 422, 262, 347, 4805, 393, 1468, 7011, 11052, 33899, 13, 51689], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1571346220079359, "compression_ratio": 1.7222222222222223, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012136056320741773}, {"id": 58, "seek": 21604, "start": 243.48, "end": 243.88, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [51735, 16805, 13, 51755], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1571346220079359, "compression_ratio": 1.7222222222222223, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012136056320741773}, {"id": 59, "seek": 24388, "start": 244.56, "end": 248.84, "text": " So essentially, what is happening here is that the old Fair Value Gap,", "tokens": [50397, 1406, 6986, 11, 644, 318, 5836, 994, 318, 326, 262, 1468, 7011, 11052, 33899, 11, 50611], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1645755418917028, "compression_ratio": 1.793103448275862, "no_speech_prob": 0.001562934136018157}, {"id": 60, "seek": 24388, "start": 249.56, "end": 257.6, "text": " instead of acting as a resistance level, when it is broken, it is not reacting as a support level,", "tokens": [50647, 2427, 286, 7205, 355, 257, 6625, 1241, 11, 618, 340, 318, 5445, 11, 340, 318, 407, 33413, 355, 257, 1104, 1241, 11, 51049], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1645755418917028, "compression_ratio": 1.793103448275862, "no_speech_prob": 0.001562934136018157}, {"id": 61, "seek": 24388, "start": 257.68, "end": 259.08, "text": " the old Fair Value Gap.", "tokens": [51053, 262, 1468, 7011, 11052, 33899, 13, 51123], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1645755418917028, "compression_ratio": 1.793103448275862, "no_speech_prob": 0.001562934136018157}, {"id": 62, "seek": 24388, "start": 259.36, "end": 265.08, "text": " And also, if there is new Fair Value Gap that is overlapping with the old Fair Value Gap,", "tokens": [51137, 843, 635, 11, 611, 612, 318, 649, 7011, 11052, 33899, 326, 318, 32997, 351, 262, 1468, 7011, 11052, 33899, 11, 51423], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1645755418917028, "compression_ratio": 1.793103448275862, "no_speech_prob": 0.001562934136018157}, {"id": 63, "seek": 24388, "start": 265.6, "end": 267.6, "text": " then that level becomes BPR.", "tokens": [51449, 788, 326, 1241, 4329, 347, 4805, 13, 51549], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1645755418917028, "compression_ratio": 1.793103448275862, "no_speech_prob": 0.001562934136018157}, {"id": 64, "seek": 26760, "start": 267.84000000000003, "end": 275.8, "text": " And trust me, that move is going to be big if your whole model was perfect.", "tokens": [50375, 843, 3774, 502, 11, 326, 1445, 318, 1016, 284, 307, 1263, 611, 534, 2187, 2746, 373, 2818, 13, 50773], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1462674681673345, "compression_ratio": 1.61244019138756, "no_speech_prob": 0.025397609919309616}, {"id": 65, "seek": 26760, "start": 277.64000000000004, "end": 281.8, "text": " So you can see Fair Value BPR right here, it overlaps.", "tokens": [50865, 1406, 345, 460, 766, 7011, 11052, 347, 4805, 826, 994, 11, 340, 12893, 1686, 13, 51073], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1462674681673345, "compression_ratio": 1.61244019138756, "no_speech_prob": 0.025397609919309616}, {"id": 66, "seek": 26760, "start": 282.20000000000005, "end": 288.28000000000003, "text": " And what I mean by overlap is it must have some part of Fair Value Gap between this box.", "tokens": [51093, 843, 644, 314, 1612, 416, 21721, 318, 340, 1276, 423, 617, 636, 286, 7011, 11052, 33899, 1022, 428, 3091, 13, 51397], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1462674681673345, "compression_ratio": 1.61244019138756, "no_speech_prob": 0.025397609919309616}, {"id": 67, "seek": 26760, "start": 288.28000000000003, "end": 292.44, "text": " So you see this box that I've drawn, you draw the box from the BPR, right?", "tokens": [51397, 1406, 345, 766, 428, 3091, 326, 314, 1053, 7428, 11, 345, 3197, 262, 3091, 422, 262, 347, 4805, 11, 826, 30, 51605], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1462674681673345, "compression_ratio": 1.61244019138756, "no_speech_prob": 0.025397609919309616}, {"id": 68, "seek": 26760, "start": 292.44, "end": 294.40000000000003, "text": " The old Fair Value Gap, you drag it along.", "tokens": [51605, 383, 1468, 7011, 11052, 33899, 11, 345, 6715, 340, 1863, 13, 51703], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1462674681673345, "compression_ratio": 1.61244019138756, "no_speech_prob": 0.025397609919309616}, {"id": 69, "seek": 29440, "start": 294.76, "end": 301.03999999999996, "text": " And if any part of the Fair Value Gap, even a tiny bit is in that level, in this box,", "tokens": [50381, 843, 611, 597, 636, 286, 262, 7011, 11052, 33899, 11, 772, 257, 7009, 1643, 318, 287, 326, 1241, 11, 287, 428, 3091, 11, 50695], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21495758403431287, "compression_ratio": 1.3835616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 0.002423478988930583}, {"id": 70, "seek": 29440, "start": 301.67999999999995, "end": 303.23999999999995, "text": " then you can take your entry from BPR.", "tokens": [50727, 788, 345, 460, 1011, 534, 5726, 422, 347, 4805, 13, 50805], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21495758403431287, "compression_ratio": 1.3835616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 0.002423478988930583}, {"id": 71, "seek": 29440, "start": 303.71999999999997, "end": 305.35999999999996, "text": " Let me show you another example.", "tokens": [50829, 3914, 502, 905, 345, 1194, 1672, 13, 50911], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21495758403431287, "compression_ratio": 1.3835616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 0.002423478988930583}, {"id": 72, "seek": 29440, "start": 309.28, "end": 310.2, "text": " Right here.", "tokens": [51107, 6498, 994, 13, 51153], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21495758403431287, "compression_ratio": 1.3835616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 0.002423478988930583}, {"id": 73, "seek": 29440, "start": 317.0, "end": 317.4, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [51493, 16805, 13, 51513], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21495758403431287, "compression_ratio": 1.3835616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 0.002423478988930583}, {"id": 74, "seek": 29440, "start": 317.96, "end": 320.28, "text": " So you can see right here.", "tokens": [51541, 1406, 345, 460, 766, 826, 994, 13, 51657], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21495758403431287, "compression_ratio": 1.3835616438356164, "no_speech_prob": 0.002423478988930583}, {"id": 75, "seek": 32028, "start": 321.28, "end": 324.88, "text": " So you have a market structure shift, right?", "tokens": [50413, 1406, 345, 423, 257, 1910, 4645, 6482, 11, 826, 30, 50593], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21277453773900082, "compression_ratio": 1.8571428571428572, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019758963026106358}, {"id": 76, "seek": 32028, "start": 324.88, "end": 325.32, "text": " Big.", "tokens": [50593, 4403, 13, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21277453773900082, "compression_ratio": 1.8571428571428572, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019758963026106358}, {"id": 77, "seek": 32028, "start": 325.91999999999996, "end": 330.2, "text": " And before market structure shift, we had this BPR right here.", "tokens": [50645, 843, 878, 1910, 4645, 6482, 11, 356, 550, 428, 347, 4805, 826, 994, 13, 50859], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21277453773900082, "compression_ratio": 1.8571428571428572, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019758963026106358}, {"id": 78, "seek": 32028, "start": 330.2, "end": 334.2, "text": " You see this old Fair Value Gap, boom, boom, boom, boom, right?", "tokens": [50859, 921, 766, 428, 1468, 7011, 11052, 33899, 11, 14166, 11, 14166, 11, 14166, 11, 14166, 11, 826, 30, 51059], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21277453773900082, "compression_ratio": 1.8571428571428572, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019758963026106358}, {"id": 79, "seek": 32028, "start": 334.96, "end": 337.32, "text": " And price did not respect this level.", "tokens": [51097, 843, 2756, 750, 407, 2461, 428, 1241, 13, 51215], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21277453773900082, "compression_ratio": 1.8571428571428572, "no_speech_prob": 0.0019758963026106358}, {"id": 80, "seek": 32028, "start": 338.23999999